00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.340
I'm not afraid of the world I haven't seen yet

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:49.220
It's the future I believed in, so let's try

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:51.920
Those countless tears

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.000
Yes, it will turn into a rainbow

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.220
I can't hold back my sadness

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:17.120
I'll aim for the top with my soul

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:22.600
I believe in love, confidence, and light

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:35.800
You're so annoying.

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:39.200
You always get in Orochimaru's way.

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:43.130
And Akatsuki is always in a bad mood.

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:45.260
You're always talking about bad things.

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:48.270
Don't you have any interesting stories?

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:49.980
I do.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:55.590
Oh, by the way, Konohamaru came to the hospital the other day.

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:57.970
What's so bright about that?

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.700
That's right. His palm is broken by his own chakra.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:08.030
It seems that Naruto-kun is teaching him Rasengan.

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:13.100
Oh, that's interesting.

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:15.390
Which one do you want?

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:15.930
Huh?

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.150
Can you learn it?

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:19.400
Can't you?

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.410
Tsunade-sama!

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:21.170
That's fine!

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:23.400
I'll let you go.

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:27.870
Please stop.

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:43.070
I can't wait any longer!

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.800
Ah! Let's go to Naruto-nii-chan right away!

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:47.600
About that Naruto-nii-chan...

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:48.200
Huh?

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:50.810
Don't you think you haven't seen him lately?

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.550
Come to think of it, I heard he came back a little while ago.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.140
I heard about it.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.800
About this mission...

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.020
It seems that it didn't go well.

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:02.590
Is that so?

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:04.190
If that's the truth,

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:07.270
It would be better to leave it alone for a while.

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:10.740
Kono-chan?

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.000
It's okay!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.760
Naruto-nii-chan is a man I've been looking forward to!

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:21.180
Kakai-sensei!

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.340
Don't you know Naruto-nii-chan?

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:24.550
Yeah, over there.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:33.990
Homaru, are you okay?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.210
What? I told you so!

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:41.020
I'm sorry I couldn't get you out.

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:43.730
Well, there were a lot of things.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:45.550
I heard about this.

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:48.260
The spy's rule was no good.

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:53.080
Yeah, even though I opened the door, I got hit by Homaru all of a sudden.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:56.540
So it's Orochimaru!

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:11.280
I found one of the hideouts and found Sasuke there, but I couldn't bring him back because I wasn't strong enough.

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:14.230
Then I had no choice but to become stronger.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:19.160
You were working, weren't you?

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:22.030
Yeah, I'm just about to move on to the next step.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:25.310
It's the Chakra of the Wind that I have.

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:28.940
Next time, I'll show you the Chakra of the Wind that I have.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:30.530
This is beyond saving.

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:33.790
As expected of Naruto-nii-chan!

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:37.160
This is my rival.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:40.720
So, what's going on with you?

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:44.020
Just watch.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:48.870
Let's go!

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:50.440
Stop!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.500
I wonder what it is.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:09.630
Oh, that's good. You did a good job.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:11.930
What's with that subtle reaction?

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:20.040
No, but why are you using the magic of the fortune-teller?

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:24.020
It's because I kept my brother's teachings and raised my eros!

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:27.380
eros?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:37.360
I have no choice but to learn the feeling of turning the chakra with my body, and I've already taught you how to do it, right?

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.380
Kakeramachi!

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:55.140
With this, you can enter the next training.

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:59.760
From here on, it's finally the last course.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.960
