00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:19.170
Well, let's start with the shadow body.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:20.990
Look closely.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:25.340
The shadow body is like this.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.600
You think you can do it, right?

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:34.620
As usual, that's all I can explain.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:39.130
The next training will be after you master this one.

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:41.590
Well then, do your best, Konohamaru.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.140
Can I just relax, Nii-chan?

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.140
What is it?

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.990
When it comes to me, Nii-chan,

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.620
my rivals want a new technique.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:55.360
So from now on, who will clear it first?

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:02.630
