00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.990
I'll accept that challenge!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:08.000
Why are you saying that?

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:09.990
Moegi, let's go eat udon!

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:10.670
What?

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:30.390
I'm going to kill you!

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.440
Should we call it a day?

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.350
Not yet.

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.040
