00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.800
This is too bad, Hamaru.

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.120
I'm gonna win this time!

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:20.400
You!

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:21.390
You!

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:25.280
I won't lose!

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:26.640
I'm gonna make you say,

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:27.900
I'm gonna make you say,

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:28.360
I'm gonna make you say,

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:28.800
I'm gonna make you say,

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:29.560
I'm gonna make you say,

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:29.960
I'm gonna make you say,

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.160
Do your best! Well, I'm going on to the next training, though.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:41.410
I see. Contact the people involved.

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:50.300
I saw it.

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:55.630
Naruto-nii-chan's next training.

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:57.990
He's making an amazing technique that only Naruto-nii-chan can do.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:00.920
Is this for real?

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:04.990
So you were here, Konohamaru.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:05.620
Huh?

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:18.190
Sarutobi Asuma-san...

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:32.150
Thank you.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:03.680
I see, so Naruto-nii-chan has decided.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:10.340
But, I...

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:15.200
This is a lesson!

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:23.160
If you're going to beat me to it...

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:23.680
I know!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.580
I can't do it right now!

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:29.440
Naruto-nii-chan...

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:35.440
I'm sure I'll make it in time for the completion of the new technique!

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:43.500
I have to catch up to that big brother!

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:58.780
I finally remember, Shadow Clone.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.300
Let's go, Naruto-nii-chan!

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:11.530
Five days, five days!

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:14.060
Oh, there you are!

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:18.090
I didn't expect you to get in.

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:21.360
Eros has been of use to me.

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:24.880
Nii-chan, you can't just sit around and do nothing, can you?

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:25.380
Maybe.

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:26.220
But!

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:28.080
I'm still in the lead!

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:31.460
I can't afford to lose to you!

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.700
Are you ready?

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:37.190
Let's start the third stage of Rasengan!

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:38.830
Yeah!

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:46.690
Why are they making shadow

