Rasengan is a really difficult technique.

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:13.460
Well, it was developed by that 4th generation.

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:20.620
It went through Jiraiya, Naruto, and now Konohamaru's kid.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:24.390
You have to live in this world to understand it.

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:26.980
And where will it go next?

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:28.590
I really want to see it.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:32.940
To the next generation...

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:37.190
The flow of time is interesting.

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:43.340
Don't forget anything.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:45.180
