00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:52.030
Naruzani!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:56.750
Did you come to see me off?

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:57.900
I'm here to complain.

00:15:58.800 --> 00:15:59.140
What?

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:02.920
What's the point of going out to the market before I can make a spiral gun?

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:05.980
No way! You're the one who's struggling!

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:12.730
If this goes on, I'll be able to completely learn it by the time my brother gets home and become really strong!

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:14.870
I'm going to be strong too!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:20.190
Oh, by the way, there's one thing I'd like to ask of you.

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:21.250
What is it?

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:25.370
I'm going to be on leave for a while, so can you take care of that thing until I get home?

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:27.690
Oh! That treasure of yours?

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:34.100
How long are you going to talk to me?

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.120
Ah, yes, yes, yes, yes.

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.010
I'm going right now.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.790
Then, I'm counting on you, Konohamaru.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:42.300
I know you're going to do it.

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:51.090
The rest is at my house.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:54.290
No, if you don't want to...

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:58.450
Naruto-nii-chan.

00:16:59.190 --> 00:16:59.570
How about now?

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:00.660
I wonder if he's practicing.

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:06.470
He's practicing with his shadow body again, isn't he?

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:08.650
Naruto-nii-chan has that kind of skill.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:12.430
I have to hurry up with the finishing of Rasengan.

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:25.100
What? It's open.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:26.240
Udon! Mugi!

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.590
Let's hurry and go back to the village!

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:56.840
I will never forgive a coward like you!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.500
I'm going to run away now, Konohamaru-kun!

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:26.010
I'll fight you!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.870
Until then, look forward to it!

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:36.160
Die!

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:49.400
What the hell did I do?

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:52.300
That's why I don't choose the right path!

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:57.540
I'll kill you first, Alto!

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:12.500
I am the descendant of the Sartobi clan!

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:15.780
The name of Sartobi is Konohamaru!

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:17.290
Remember this!

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:32.910
I heard about it, Konohamaru.

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:34.770
It seems you defeated one of the Pain.

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.170
I didn't come here to chase after you.

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:42.630
But I can't beat you, who protected all of Konoha.

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:46.520
That's true.

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:49.620
Besides, there are a lot of things I couldn't protect.

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.200
Naruto...

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:56.660
Ah! I have something I want to show you!

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:58.360
H-Hey!

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:00.770
Where are you going?

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.600
Just follow me!

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:06.520
Where is this?

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:08.730
Why is it at the evacuation center?

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:10.290
This is what's important.

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:19.240
Luxury warehouse?

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:21.520
And this is the orange space.

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:27.000
Ta-da!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:34.850
This is my memory.

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:37.390
It's a precious treasure.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:40.400
I brought it here just in case.

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:42.940
I kept my promise.

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:47.730
Ohamaru, you're a great guy.

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:49.190
Of course.

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:52.150
I'm a man who fights with my older brother.

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:57.670
And I'll be your rival from now on.

00:20:57.930 --> 00:20:58.450
Yeah!

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:25.510
I thought I wasn't the only one who suddenly felt the pain of the person who opened it.

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:34.850
But the tears I shed, the bitterness I bite into

00:22:39.280 --> 00:22:43.530
Even from here, I can clearly feel the power of the old man on the other side.

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:45.790
You can't defeat me.

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:48.800
I have obtained the eternal life, so to speak.

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:51.340
Idiot!

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:53.590
I'm not going to defeat you.

00:22:54.610 --> 00:22:55.810
We're going to defeat you!

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:59.700
Next time on Naruto Shippuden, I'll win!

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:02.490
You too, Madara.
